{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_15059","headline":"清如玉壶冰 · 卢纶","name":"清如玉壶冰","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"玉壶冰始结，循吏政初成。\n既有虚心鉴，还如照胆清。\n瑶池慙洞澈，金镜让澄明。\n气若朝霜动，形随夜月盈。\n临人能不蔽，待物本无情。\n怯对圆光裹，妍蚩自此呈。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"卢纶","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_15059.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_15059","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}